{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Haunt Hunter</i> blends psychological horror, exploration, and survival mechanics set inside the eerie halls of <strong>Anya Manon Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore &amp; Investigate -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search dark rooms, labs, and wards for notes to uncover what happened within the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/0c4b744714cff5fa27fc980b651d95a3.poster.avif?t=1761400313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/0c4b744714cff5fa27fc980b651d95a3.webm?t=1761400313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/0c4b744714cff5fa27fc980b651d95a3.mp4?t=1761400313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Combat System -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend yourself with the limited weapons found across the hospital. Ammunition and resources are scarce, so every shot counts. Use your Melee Combat moves to defend yourself in some situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Immersive Horror -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lighting, haunting design, and enemy encounters create a tense, ever-changing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.poster.avif?t=1761400313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.webm?t=1761400313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.mp4?t=1761400313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252220?t=1761400313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/a284cfd3b6c1b5fd2dd9e3871fa6279e1127ba42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761400313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/022a4bf9bd399323200d09eefaa53ed0bdaa5781/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761400313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/022a4bf9bd399323200d09eefaa53ed0bdaa5781/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761400313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4110160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Haunt Hunter</i> blends psychological horror, exploration, and survival mechanics set inside the eerie halls of <strong>Anya Manon Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore &amp; Investigate -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Search dark rooms, labs, and wards for notes to uncover what happened within the hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/0c4b744714cff5fa27fc980b651d95a3.poster.avif?t=176140031